WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.202
-The House Judiciary Committee

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:04.670
released their full impeachment
report yesterday

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.439
and in it, they accuse
President Trump

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.773
of committing multiple crimes,

00:00:07.773 --> 00:00:10.343
in addition to those for which
he's being impeached.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:13.412
And while we can't talk about
every single crime

00:00:13.412 --> 00:00:16.616
he may have committed, we can
at least show them to you.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:20.086
And in the meantime, I'm going
to sit here and sip my tea.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.554
Here we go.

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:24.824 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:28.127 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:30.296 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:35.702 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:39.338 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:42.608 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:45.845 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:49.715 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:53.219 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:56.723 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:58.725 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.725 --> 00:01:02.595 line:0%
